列等額付款，按照約定付款期數的定期利率。","Calculates the number of compounding periods necessary to increase an investment of present value to a future value, at a fixed interest rate per compounding period.":"計算一項投資的現值要到達某未來值所需的複利期數，每個複利期間的利率為固定的。","Calculates the number of payment periods that are necessary during the term of an ordinary annuity, to accumulate a future value, at a periodic interest rate.":"計算普通年金累積至未來值所需的付款期數，按照某一定期利率。","Calculates the periodic interest necessary to increase an investment to a future value, over the number of compounding periods. ":"計算投資增加到未來值所需的定期利率，按照複利期數。","Calculates the present value of an investment based on a series of equal payments discounted at a periodic interest rate over the number of payment periods in the term. ":"計算投資的現值，根據一系列等額付款，按照約定付款期數的定期利率下進行折現。","Calculates the resale price of a product, based on the product cost and the wanted gross profit margin.":"計算轉售價格的產品，根據產品成本和希望的毛利率。","Calculates the straight-line depreciation of an asset for one period. The straight-line method of depreciation divides the depreciable cost evenly over the useful life of an asset. The useful life is the number of periods, typically years, over which an asset is depreciated. ":"計算一期間內資產的直線折舊。直線折舊法在資產可用年限內將折舊花費平均分攤。可用年限指資產折舊的期數，典型狀況下為年。","Calculating":"計算中","Calculator":"計數機","Canadian Dollar":"加拿大元","Ceiling":"上限","Celsius":"攝氏","Centimeters":"厘米","Ch_aracter:":"字符(_A)：","Chilean Peso":"智利比索","Chinese Yuan":"人民幣","Clear":"清除","Clear Display [Escape]":"清除顯示 [Escape]","Colombian Peso":"哥倫比亞比索","Complex argument":"複數輻角","Complex conjugate":"共軛複數","Compounding Term":"複利期間","Cosine":"餘弦","Croatian Kuna":"克羅地亞庫那","Ctrm":"Ctrm","Cubic Meters":"立方米","Currency":"貨幣","Czech Koruna":"捷克克朗","Danish Krone":"丹麥克朗","Days":"天","Ddb":"Ddb","Decimal":"10 進位","Degrees":"度","Displayed value not an integer":"顯示的數值不是整數值","Divide [/]":"除號 [/]","Division by zero is undefined":"除以 0 並無意義","Double Declining Depreciation":"雙倍餘額遞減折舊法","Double-Declining Depreciation":"雙倍餘額遞減折舊法","Dur